    "description": "In this video, learn how to make a homemade naan bread recipe that is soft and chewy with a delicate, buttery taste. Naan is an oven-baked, leavened bread that is commonly served with curries, soups, and dips, enriched with ingredients like yogurt, milk, and eggs, which makes it softer than other baked flatbreads like pita and roti. Home cooks can easily make it using simple ingredients like flour, yeast, milk, and butter, and this version of the dough is seasoned with garlic and salt. ",
